Thanks to all our loyal players for helping THE BATTLE CATS reach 22 million downloads!
To show our appreciation, we'll be giving you {{Color|#FF00FF|'''22 Cat Food'''}} once every day until March 7th! ALL RIGHT!!!

Even with 22 million players around the world, the quest of the fighting felines is far, far from over...
We've got more cool content in the works for you, so keep an eye out as we release more details!

